<rml>
<head><title>Farkle — Main Menu</title><link type="text/rcss" href="farkle.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="menus.rcss"/></head>
<body class="menu-screen" data-screen="menu">
<div id="main-board" class="wood-panel">
<button id="start-button" class="menu-button primary">Play</button>
<button id="settings-button" class="menu-button" data-page="settings-graphics.rml">Settings</button>
<button id="credits-button" class="menu-button" data-page="credits.rml">Credits</button>
<button id="exit-button" class="menu-button">Exit</button>
<img class="fleur-mark" sprite="fleur"/><div class="menu-flavor">Same dice. New stories.</div>
</div>
<div id="story-card" class="parchment"><img class="fleur-mark" sprite="fleur"/><h1>More Than<br/>a Game</h1><div class="menu-flavor">In every roll, a chance.<br/>Good company turns<br/>simple games into<br/>unforgettable nights.</div><img class="fleur-mark" sprite="fleur"/></div>
<div class="menu-masthead"><div class="menu-title">Farkle</div><div class="menu-subtitle">A tavern game of dice</div></div>
</body></rml>
